# Raw capture bulk from the EarTTS truncation campaigns. The conclusions,
# summaries and per-case verdicts are committed; these are the multi-gigabyte
# inputs they were derived from, regenerable by the retained tooling.
*container*.log
**/events.jsonl
**/positions.jsonl
**/matrix.jsonl
**/report.json
**/raw-response.wav
**/actual-decoder-response.wav
rate-baseline/microphone.wav
rate-baseline/**/*.wav
**/*.wav
**/*.pt
**/*.pcm
**/*.safetensors

# Keep the small artefacts that carry the findings.
!**/README.md
!**/summary.json
!**/matrix-summary.json
!**/classification.json
!**/preflight.json
!**/transcripts.json

# The original live session's clips are the evidence base for the ASR verdict
# and are deliberately tracked; see session-431ac6df/README.md.
!session-431ac6df/*.wav
